The e-means algorithm in this package is ported from the Python code in
faiss contrib/e_means at commit 2b648f0605f2ef3d14c4705350f8a0b214463878
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss), written by Gergely Szilvasy,
Swann Bessa and Matthijs Douze. These files are derived from it:

  R/constants.R, R/recipe.R, R/revival.R, R/state.R, R/backend-cpu.R and
  R/backend-torch.R, which port the recipe, schedule, update, revival and
  closing steps;

  tests/testthat/test-recipe.R and tests/testthat/test-upstream-contracts.R,
  which port reference values and behaviour from faiss tests/test_e_means.py
  and tests/e_means_test_utils.py.

